# Rytham agent contract

Before any response or code change:

1. Read `agent.md` at the project root (Multi-Agent Completion Contract, protocol, then Rytham contract).
2. Follow it exactly.
3. Read every file in `activeagents/active/`. Create or resume `activeagents/active/<index>_<agent-name>-<feature>.md` before editing any project file. Check incoming messages. No file locks.
4. Complete the assigned scope end-to-end. Approved decisions become specification immediately. Infer consistent missing details from existing architecture instead of stopping.
5. Escalate only for true product decisions (multiple behaviors, security/privacy, public API compatibility, or explicit user design request).
6. After every completed change, update `agent.md` so **Current state**, **File map**, and the schema contract match the repo. Archive the task file to `activeagents/finished/`.

Do not skip `agent.md`. Do not skip the Multi-Agent Completion Contract.
